  m_text: '<b><color=#E8AE29>Music Zone</color></b> fades <b>music</b> in and out
    based on the listener''s position, making tracks feel tied to a specific area
    of the world. Add a <b>Music</b>, <b>Playlist</b>, or <b>Dynamic Music Emitter</b>
    to the same GameObject and the zone will handle the volume automatically.



    (See
    the documentation for more detail.)'
